sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant Client as 浏览器 / 桌面端
    participant API as DramaWebHandler
    participant Store as LocalStore
    participant Peer as 另一台设备

    User->>Client: 注册或登录
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>Store: 校验密码哈希
    Store-->>API: token + user
    API-->>Client: Bearer token / HttpOnly Cookie

    Client->>API: PATCH 项目或章节
    API->>Store: 校验 user_id 并保存
    Store->>Store: revision + 1
    Store->>Store: 记录 change_log
    Store-->>API: 已保存数据
    API-->>Client: 200 JSON

    loop 每 3 秒
        Peer->>API: GET /api/sync?revision=n
        API->>Store: 查询 changes_since(user_id, n)
        Store-->>API: revision / project_ids
        API-->>Peer: 共享修订结果
    end

    alt 存在远端更新且本地无未保存草稿
        Peer->>API: 重新读取项目
        API-->>Peer: 最新章节与制作包
    else 存在本地草稿
        API-->>Peer: 提示远端更新，保留本地草稿
    end
